Sample data and safety
----------------------

Everything the demo shows runs on SAMPLE data. The ERP it posts to is a
simulator (services/erp-sim), and the maker in the "is this unit really
new?" check is simulated too. Nothing in this repository is certified for
a real warehouse, a real ERP or safety-critical work: the tower and
climbing features support a site's own safety procedures and never replace
them.
